WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.028
Today, Mom is taking me to the big city.

2
00:00:15.029 --> 00:00:20.803
I'm visiting my dad!

3
00:00:20.804 --> 00:00:26.100
It's very sunny!

4
00:00:26.101 --> 00:00:28.699
So I wear sunscreen.

5
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:37.051
It protects my skin.

6
00:00:37.052 --> 00:00:42.432
I'm in the car.

7
00:00:42.433 --> 00:00:44.914
So I wear a seat belt.

8
00:00:44.915 --> 00:00:50.738
It protects my body.

9
00:00:50.739 --> 00:00:54.001
It's very bright!

10
00:00:54.002 --> 00:00:56.867
So I wear sunglasses.

11
00:00:56.868 --> 00:01:04.740
They protect my eyes.

12
00:01:04.741 --> 00:01:08.656
It's very dangerous!

13
00:01:08.657 --> 00:01:11.604
So I wear a hard hat.

14
00:01:11.605 --> 00:01:18.055
It protects my head.

15
00:01:18.056 --> 00:01:21.684
It's very dusty!

16
00:01:21.685 --> 00:01:24.536
So I wear a mask.

17
00:01:24.537 --> 00:01:29.926
It protects my throat.

18
00:01:29.927 --> 00:01:36.571
It's very high!

19
00:01:36.572 --> 00:01:40.309
So my dad holds my hand.

20
00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:43.495
He protects me.

21
00:01:43.496 --> 00:01:53.351
Wow! The city is very beautiful!
